def find_common_elements(arr1, arr2):
    # Create a set of the first array to remove duplicates
    set1 = set(arr1)
    
    # Create a list of the second array
    list2 = list(arr2)
    
    # Find the intersection of the two sets
    common_elements = list(set1.intersection(list2))
    
    return common_elements
```
